WEBVTT

00:23:27.954 --> 00:23:32.204
is there a near future where you can say
to your eye, OK, I'm going to bed now,

00:23:32.246 --> 00:23:35.288
but in the morning I'd love
you to present me with

00:23:35.288 --> 00:23:40.288
a thousand tuba jingles with words
attached that you have of

00:23:40.288 --> 00:23:43.163
a sort of mean factor to the and you
come down in the morning and

00:23:43.163 --> 00:23:47.079
the computer shows you the stuff. And one
of them, you go, wow, that is it.

00:23:47.079 --> 00:23:50.288
That is a top 10 hit and you
build a song from it.

00:23:50.288 --> 00:23:53.663
Or is that going to be released?
Actually be the value add.

00:23:53.954 --> 00:23:56.038
We released something last
year called Jukebox,

00:23:56.038 --> 00:23:58.038
which is very near what you described,

00:23:58.038 --> 00:24:00.996
where you can say I want music generated
for me in this style